  _id: 14041203
  _key: DIALOGUE_SERAPHINE_NODE_FIRST_FLAME
  _displayName: 
  _description: 
  _speakerName: Seraphine
  _dialogueSegments:
  - I am Seraphine, one of the few remaining guardians of the First Flame.
  - Lost Embers are fragments of its lingering power. Though faint, they may strengthen
    those capable of bearing them.
  - My order once protected that power, keeping the sacred fires alive against the
    gathering darkness.
  - We failed. And now, the world bears the scars of our failure.
  _dialogueText: 'I am Seraphine, one of the few remaining guardians of the First
    Flame.

    Lost Embers are fragments of its lingering power. Though faint, they
    may strengthen those capable of bearing them.

    My order once protected that
    power, keeping the sacred fires alive against the gathering darkness.

    We
    failed. And now, the world bears the scars of our failure.'
  _choices:
  - _choiceText: What happened to your order?
